# Output files
aq_maps/
*.html
*.jpg
*.png

# pkgdown site (built locally, never committed)
docs/

# manual screenshots are committed
!vignettes/figures/*.png

# the package's own HTML templates ARE committed: *.html above was aimed at
# generated maps, but it was also swallowing these, so a fresh clone could not
# build a map at all (found 2026-08-05, and they had never been committed)
!inst/**/*.html

# concept demonstrations ARE committed: they are the only evidence a retired
# or deferred idea was built and worked, and aq_maps is not in the repository
!dev/concepts/examples/*.html
!dev/concepts/examples/*.jpg
!dev/concepts/examples/*.png

